## 免责声明 / Disclaimer

本工具输出的金额为**基于所提供费率卡与系统数据重算的结果**，不构成供应商应付账款的法律依据。所有差异项在与供应商沟通前，应人工复核原始凭证。

THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND. Computed
amounts are estimates derived from the supplied rate cards and system data and
must be manually verified against source documents before being used in any
commercial dispute or payment decision.
